    {
      "t": "0:10",
      "step": "Chicken breasts on 2 parchment pans: garlic-ginger (Tue) and lemon-oregano (Sat)."
    },
    {
      "t": "0:20",
      "step": "Chloe's nuggets (egg + seasoned breadcrumbs, light spray), bake or air-fry. Potato wedges on a parchment pan with spray (Mon lunch). Mix the Greek yogurt honey mustard."
    },
    {
      "t": "0:30",
      "step": "Brown extra-lean beef in broth, then stir in bloomed gelatin (Wed)."
    },
    {
      "t": "0:40",
      "step": "Honey cashew sauce, burger sauce, tzatziki. Toast cashews (store separately)."
    },
    {
      "t": "0:50",
      "step": "Cauliflower rice saut\u00e9ed in broth, then folded into half the rice. Egg bites into the oven."
    },
    {
      "t": "1:00",
      "step": "Creami pints blended and frozen."
    },
    {
      "t": "1:10",
      "step": "Cut peppers and broccoli for Tue; shred the honey-lime cabbage slaw for Mon tacos; wash romaine, slice tomatoes and pickles for Wed; cut fruit for Chloe's lunches."
    },
    {
      "t": "1:20",
      "step": "Weigh, portion, label. Freeze Sat's chicken, then move it to the fridge Thu night."
    },
    {
      "t": "1:30",
      "step": "Done. At dinner (this week's Sun): broth-and-yogurt mashed potatoes and shaved fennel-apple slaw."
